Shared logging format

Each log entry should look similar to this:
{
  "timestamp": "2026-03-23T16:45:12.381920",
  "session_id": "2026-03-23_study_session_01",
  "module": "distraction_detection",
  "event_type": "warning_triggered",
  "value": "distraction",
  "details": {
    "attention_state": "LOOKING_LEFT",
    "posture_state": "OK",
    "phone_present": false,
    "duration_seconds": 5.2
  }
}


Example Required fields:
	•	timestamp: ISO format string
	•	session_id: same session ID across all modules
	•	module: which subsystem created the log
	•	event_type: category of event
	•	value: short main value
	•	details: extra structured info


Example Event Types:
Distraction module
	•	state_update
	•	warning_triggered
	•	punishment_ready
	•	phone_detected
	•	focus_restored
	•	idle_detected
	•	app_blacklist_detected

Facial recognition module
	•	user_detected
	•	profile_loaded
	•	face_unknown

Hardware module
	•	light_changed
	•	servo_moved
	•	water_gun_triggered
	•	buzzer_triggered

Environment module
	•	temperature_reading
	•	noise_reading
	•	light_reading

Session manager
	•	session_started
	•	session_paused
	•	session_resumed
	•	session_ended